  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/02/IMG_7272.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>L&#39;auditori de la Uni&oacute; Musical Santa Cec&iacute;lia de Suera ha acollit la vesprada d&#39;aquest dissabte l&#39;audici&oacute; de l&#39;alumnat de l&#39;escola de m&uacute;sica, fins i tot de les persones, ja adultes,&nbsp;que han optat pel cant i que tenen com objectiu tornar a posar en marxa la coral.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audicioescolamusicasuera13/img_7272.jpg\" alt=\"img_7272\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audicioescolamusicasuera13/img_7273.jpg\" alt=\"img_7273\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audicioescolamusicasuera13/img_7274.jpg\" alt=\"img_7274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audicioescolamusicasuera13/img_7275.jpg\" alt=\"img_7275\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audicioescolamusicasuera13/img_7276.jpg\" alt=\"img_7276\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audicioescolamusicasuera13/img_7277.jpg\" alt=\"img_7277\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audicioescolamusicasuera13/img_7278.jpg\" alt=\"img_7278\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audicioescolamusicasuera13/img_7279.jpg\" alt=\"img_7279\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audicioescolamusicasuera13/img_7280.jpg\" alt=\"img_7280\" style=\"max-w